Theorem nonhalt_1RB1LB_1LC0LA_0RD0RD_1LA1RD : NonHalt tm_1RB1LB_1LC0LA_0RD0RD_1LA1RD.
Proof. apply never_qh_tr_nonhalt, nqhtr_1RB1LB_1LC0LA_0RD0RD_1LA1RD. Qed.

