    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB1LB_1RC0LB_1LA0RD____0RC p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB1LB_1RC0LB_1LA0RD____0RC p j' E).
    + lia.
